{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and unlock the ultimate weapons in a hectic physics playground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Stickman Physics Battle Arena, you must kill countless enemies to increase your stats and become the greatest warrior!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649420/extras/f3db835f77ae38ce2fbf0f568cae7f6d.avif?t=1761780385\" width=908 height=689 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Welcome to the Battle Arena! \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Dismember your enemies, litter the arena with bodies and paint the town red to earn 3 stars in every level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Let loose in a physics playground where everything is interactive; throw shoot and explode weapons, items, opponents, structures and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Dual wield over 75 fun and unique weapons used by knights, ninjas, soldiers, scientists and sorcerers, as well as power tools and even toys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Play 2 player co-op and VS; play with 1 or 2 gamepads, dual control with touch or enable player AI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Custom made interactive music takes you on a journey as you progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Track your stats throughout your career</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f 7 different game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Campaign: 26 levels with progressively tougher enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Battle Arena: 7 survival levels where you fight until you drop for a big reward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Challengers: 13 Bosses to challenge your skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Twin Serpent: A continuous side scrolling adventure with an overhead view paying homage to arcade games of old</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Invasion: Slime mold has invaded the world! Defeat the horrible blobs and the zombies they created in this continuous side scrolling mode featuring random weapon drops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Defense: Defend or destroy your angry birds style physics tower in an ongoing battle against waves of enemies in 6 different stages across 22 levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f VS: Enter the ring against a friend with 2 player vs mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649420/extras/5e49ce5946fdfea0428867e46a62346a.avif?t=1761780385\" width=908 height=689 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649420?t=1761780385","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649420/a5d73bde74222083229e00e5e946b5687100691d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761780385","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649420/252d1fe8cf6e72cbc89adf0646d36b4378f7b2e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761780385","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649420/252d1fe8cf6e72cbc89adf0646d36b4378f7b2e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761780385","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood can be disabled or changed in settings."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and unlock the ultimate weapons in a hectic physics playground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Stickman Physics Battle Arena, you must kill countless enemies to increase your stats and become the greatest warrior!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649420/extras/f3db835f77ae38ce2fbf0f568cae7f6d.avif?t=1761780385\" width=908 height=689 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Welcome to the Battle Arena! \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Dismember your enemies, litter the arena with bodies and paint the town red to earn 3 stars in every level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Let loose in a physics playground where everything is interactive; throw shoot and explode weapons, items, opponents, structures and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Dual wield over 75 fun and unique weapons used by knights, ninjas, soldiers, scientists and sorcerers, as well as power tools and even toys</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Play 2 player co-op and VS; play with 1 or 2 gamepads, dual control with touch or enable player AI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Custom made interactive music takes you on a journey as you progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Track your stats throughout your career</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f 7 different game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Campaign: 26 levels with progressively tougher enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Battle Arena: 7 survival levels where you fight until you drop for a big reward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Challengers: 13 Bosses to challenge your skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Twin Serpent: A continuous side scroll